<meta name="description" content="English is the language of instruction and examination at the University of Toronto, and success in our programs requires a high level of English language proficiency. Do you need to submit proof of English language skills?If English is your first language (i.e. the first language you learned at home as a child), you do not need to submit proof of English language proficiency." />
