          <div  class="layout__region layout__region--second">
        <div>
  
    
      
                        <div class="field field-name-body"><div class="tex2jax_process"><div>
  
  
                        <div class="field field-name-field-media-image">    <picture>
                  <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xxl/public/2026-09/banner_ifp_0.png.webp?itok=6oI6RXvg 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xxxl/public/2026-09/banner_ifp_0.png.webp?itok=8jSPsCYf 2x" media="all and (min-width: 992px)" type="image/webp" width="1320" height="440">
              <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xl/public/2026-09/banner_ifp_0.png.webp?itok=tkWcc8TF 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xxl/public/2026-09/banner_ifp_0.png.webp?itok=6oI6RXvg 2x" media="all and (min-width: 768px)" type="image/webp" width="1440" height="480">
              <source srcset="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_l/public/2026-09/banner_ifp_0.png.webp?itok=OvSCjsJZ 1x, /future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_xl/public/2026-09/banner_ifp_0.png.webp?itok=tkWcc8TF 2x" type="image/webp" width="960" height="320">
                  <img loading="lazy" width="720" height="240" src="/future-students/sites/files/future-students/styles/full_width_m/public/2026-09/banner_ifp_0.png.webp?itok=vgYkYnR2" alt="International Foundation Program at U of T Mississauga">

  </picture>

</div>
            
</div>
<p>The International Foundation Program (IFP) is a unique offering that combines conditional acceptance to the University of Toronto with intensive English language instruction and academic skills development instruction, combined with for-credit courses.</p><p><a class="btn btn-action" href="/future-students/ifp" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="f4fddb10-16b9-4253-9831-aa69e6158d6a" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="International Foundation Program at U of T Mississauga">Learn more</a></p></div></div>
            
  </div>

